    {
      "id": "astral",
      "title": "Astral Diplomacy",
      "body": "Astral is a 2 vs 1 space shooter. Think of it as a boss fight, one player controls the boss and two players control the small attacking ships. It's much easier to play as the boss, but it's more satisfying to win as the small ships, an odd trade off creating an interesting asymmetrical game.",
